sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Cliente
    participant WA as WhatsApp/Web
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant Q as Quotation
    participant P as Proforma
    participant B as Billing & Tax
    participant D as Documents
    participant N as Notifications
    participant AR as Accounts Receivable
    participant BI as Analytics/BI

    Cliente->>WA: Solicitar cotizacion
    WA->>GW: RequestQuote
    GW->>Q: Crear cotizacion
    Q-->>GW: QuoteRequested
    Q-->>Cliente: Cotizacion en revision

    Cliente->>WA: Aprobar cotizacion
    WA->>GW: ApproveQuote
    GW->>Q: Aprobar
    Q-->>GW: QuoteApproved
    Q-->>Cliente: Cotizacion aprobada

    GW->>P: CreateProformaFromQuote
    P-->>GW: ProformaCreated
    loop Parcialidades
        Cliente->>WA: Registrar entrega parcial
        WA->>GW: RecordDelivery
        GW->>P: Actualizar proforma
        P-->>GW: DeliveryRecorded
    end
    WA->>GW: CloseProforma
    GW->>P: Cerrar proforma
    P-->>GW: ProformaClosed

    GW->>B: PreviewInvoice
    B-->>GW: Vista previa
    WA->>GW: Confirmar emision
    GW->>B: IssueInvoice
    B->>B: Validar ITBIS + NCF
    B->>B: Asignar NCF
    B-->>GW: InvoiceIssued

    GW->>D: RenderDocument(invoice)
    D->>D: Generar PDF
    D->>D: Guardar en S3
    D-->>GW: DocumentRendered + Link

    GW->>N: Enviar factura
    N->>N: WhatsApp/Email
    N-->>GW: InvoiceSent
    N-->>Cliente: Factura + link

    B-->>AR: InvoiceIssued (evento)
    AR->>AR: Registrar CxC
    AR-->>GW: PaymentApplied

    B-->>BI: InvoiceIssued (evento)
    P-->>BI: ProformaClosed (evento)
    AR-->>BI: PaymentApplied (evento)
